00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:54.040
Yokoha-san, the usual suspect is the true suspect.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.880
Which means Milky Holmes need to protect Yokohama!

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:00.170
Stone River-san, Twenty-san and Last Samurai-san needs rescuing!

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:02.570
Whatever. Henriette-san was always defending Yokohama!

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:08.890
Don't just (exchange) those "I know it all" expressions.

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.520
Next time, Lard God.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.690
The culprit is Milky Holmes!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.980
We finally got our lines straight!
